sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor L as Learner
participant B as Browser SPA
participant A as FastAPI /sessions
participant D as PostgreSQL
L->>B: choose FIXED (Test) style + mix
B->>A: POST /practice/start
A->>D: session purpose=TEST, review_policy=AI_OFFICIAL_REVIEW
B->>A: GET /sessions/{id}/paper
B->>A: GET /paper/{seq_no}
B->>A: PUT /paper/{seq_no}/draft
B->>A: PUT /paper/{seq_no}/flag
B->>A: POST /paper/tab-leave (server counter)
B->>A: POST /paper/submit
A->>D: finalize + V1 result_version
A->>D: publication OFFICIAL, release_status=published
A-->>B: next = /evaluations/{id}
B->>A: GET /evaluations/attempts/{id}
A-->>B: official V1 score + evidence
